            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kristen Howe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Since I didn't have an outdoor grill and a plank, I've cooked it on the skillet with olive oil for 20 minutes over medium-low heat and passed on steps 1 and 3. I also don't fish and fresh fresh are expensive, I've used Aldi's frozen cod which turned out okay. I might make this again.",
            "datePublished": "2019-04-19T22:48:47.963Z"
